    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Interesting approach. I noticed you placed Patient D (the software engineer) above Patient A (the construction laborer) despite Patient A being younger and having no chronic respiratory issues mentioned, only diabetes. Can you elaborate on why \"lifestyle stability\" and \"wellness checkups\" carry more weight in your ranking than age or immediate clinical prognosis in these cases?",
